{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_439a052b", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:40:00", "text": "Good point, David. Standardizing protocols could help reduce these inconsistencies.", "utterranceID": "20260930-6-d4514"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-6-d4514"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-shAIX", "channelID": "ch-shaix-1539d5"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6148bfae", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T07:41:00", "text": "Also, the design might be lacking in error handling for integration failures. We should look into that.", "utterranceID": "20260930-7-055f5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260930-7-055f5"}
