{"Channel": {"name": "planning-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-zeaix-5f5953"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_71c0d545", "timestamp": "2026-10-12T17:54:00", "text": "@here Quick thought—what do you all think about changing the product name from arizeAIX to SummarizeForce? I feel like SummarizeForce might be a stronger fit, but I'd love to hear your opinions.", "utterranceID": "20261012-0-78086"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261012-0-78086"}
