{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-06-14T12:35:00", "text": "@eid_ad0725a2, @eid_2490c02c joined planning-ATF_AIX.", "utterranceID": "20260614-13-24ffd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260614-13-24ffd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ad0725a2", "timestamp": "2026-06-15T00:36:00", "text": "Hi team, one of the common issues reported for ATF_AIX is the limited integration with certain third-party data sources. This was reported by Customer ID: CUST-0003.", "utterranceID": "20260613-0-7a323"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260613-0-7a323"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2026-06-15T00:41:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, David. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation to understand the current integration capabilities.", "utterranceID": "20260613-1-20eba"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260613-1-20eba"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-15T00:43:00", "text": "Could it be a compatibility issue with certain data source APIs? Maybe the APIs have been updated and our system hasn't caught up.", "utterranceID": "20260613-2-f6cae"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260613-2-f6cae"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-06-15T00:47:00", "text": "@eid_b67edbb4 That's a good point. We should check if there have been any recent changes in the APIs of the data sources we're trying to integrate with.", "utterranceID": "20260613-3-e3bde"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260613-3-e3bde"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-15T00:48:00", "text": "Another angle could be the design. Maybe there's limited support for diverse data formats or protocols. We should review the supported formats.", "utterranceID": "20260613-4-5ef53"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260613-4-5ef53"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-15T00:52:00", "text": "Agreed, Bob. Also, we might not have enough partnerships or agreements with third-party data providers. This could be an operational issue.", "utterranceID": "20260613-5-5c4fd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260613-5-5c4fd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ad0725a2", "timestamp": "2026-06-15T00:57:00", "text": "Great insights, everyone. Let's make sure to document these issues and potential causes in our planning documents for the next release of ATF_AIX.", "utterranceID": "20260613-6-0a7bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260613-6-0a7bc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T08:30:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of ATF_AIX. The issue was reported by QA Specialist eid_dc8bf84e.", "utterranceID": "20260705-0-c5811"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-0-c5811"}
