{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2470307f", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T06:45:00", "text": "Hi team, I noticed that PR# 25, which implements JWT for secure authentication, is approved but not merged yet. I've heard that our product direction has changed, and this PR might not be necessary anymore. Can we discuss this?", "utterranceID": "20270206-0-ffe3c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-0-ffe3c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_515ae627", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T06:48:00", "text": "Sure, @eid_2470307f. Can someone clarify what the new product direction is and why JWT is no longer needed?", "utterranceID": "20270206-1-fd984"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-1-fd984"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_320cd970", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T06:50:00", "text": "From what I understand, we're moving towards a different authentication strategy that aligns better with our new architecture. JWT might not fit into this new plan.", "utterranceID": "20270206-2-c5aaf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-2-c5aaf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T06:51:00", "text": "That's correct. The new strategy involves a more centralized authentication service that doesn't use JWT. It should simplify our system and improve integration with other services.", "utterranceID": "20270206-3-ac50f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-3-ac50f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f26c6e5", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T06:54:00", "text": "Does this mean the work done in PR# 25 is completely obsolete, or is there any part of it that can be reused?", "utterranceID": "20270206-4-50fbb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-4-50fbb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_136119e9", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T06:58:00", "text": "I authored the PR. Most of the work is specific to JWT, so it might not be reusable if we're moving away from that approach.", "utterranceID": "20270206-5-bd7f9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-5-bd7f9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5346d7a5", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T07:02:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification, @eid_136119e9. Given this context, should we decide not to merge the PR?", "utterranceID": "20270206-6-cc6ef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-6-cc6ef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_47d43bc4", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T07:04:00", "text": "I agree. If the PR doesn't align with our new direction, it makes sense not to merge it.", "utterranceID": "20270206-7-8f326"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-7-8f326"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-6723be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_62e8e52d", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T07:07:00", "text": "I concur. It's better to avoid merging something that won't be used and could complicate our codebase.", "utterranceID": "20270206-8-6edc2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270206-8-6edc2"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_36319f22", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:21:00", "text": "Thanks for bringing this up, Fiona. Since the product was developed by a different team, we might need to dig into their documentation to understand the infrastructure setup.", "utterranceID": "20260418-1-c033d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-1-c033d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_798684b4", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:22:00", "text": "Good point, Julia. It could be an unstable infrastructure or server issues. We should check the server logs for any anomalies during the reported downtimes.", "utterranceID": "20260418-2-d1621"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-2-d1621"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:23:00", "text": "@eid_798684b4, I agree. Also, we should evaluate our current maintenance and monitoring practices. Maybe they're not adequate enough to catch issues before they cause downtime.", "utterranceID": "20260418-3-d435e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-3-d435e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:26:00", "text": "Alice here. Another angle could be the lack of redundancy and failover mechanisms. If one server goes down, there should be a backup to take over immediately.", "utterranceID": "20260418-4-3108c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-4-3108c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:26:58", "text": "@here Read this article on how Salesforce is integrating AI to enhance data analytics capabilities, a must-read for understanding the future of data-driven decision-making. https://www.forbes.com/sites/salesforce-ai-integration", "utterranceID": "20260316-34-66041"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260316-34-66041"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:27:00", "text": "Ian here. We should also consider setting up alerts for any unusual activity. That way, we can respond faster to potential issues.", "utterranceID": "20260418-5-b75f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-5-b75f8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-03-16T23:28:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone. Let's make sure these customer issues are documented in the planning documents for the next release of dAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260418-6-67ccb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260418-6-67ccb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-03-17T00:17:00", "text": "@eid_7f69c513 joined planning-dAIX.", "utterranceID": "20260317-36-b63c2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260317-36-b63c2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T10:58:00", "text": "Hi team, QA team found some issues in the last release of dAIX. The report came from QA Specialist eid_4f731d34.", "utterranceID": "20260404-0-349cb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-0-349cb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_792330e0", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T11:02:26", "text": "@here Check out this insightful blog on leveraging AI for trend analysis in organizational data. It dives deep into how AI can help businesses stay ahead of the curve. https://towardsdatascience.com/ai-for-trend-analysis-in-business-1234567890ab", "utterranceID": "20260318-39-f1bc7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260318-39-f1bc7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7c6dd6a6", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T11:03:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian. What exactly did they find?", "utterranceID": "20260404-1-174cc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-1-174cc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c7622c8e", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T11:06:00", "text": "The main issue is inconsistent performance, especially during peak usage times. It seems to be affecting productivity.", "utterranceID": "20260404-2-de644"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-2-de644"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T11:07:00", "text": "Could it be due to insufficient server capacity or resource allocation during high demand?", "utterranceID": "20260404-3-9f931"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-3-9f931"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_435d10af", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T11:09:00", "text": "That's possible, Ian. We should check the server logs to see if there are any resource spikes.", "utterranceID": "20260404-4-fcec7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-4-fcec7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-dAIX", "channelID": "ch--daix-b73085"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7f69c513", "timestamp": "2026-03-18T11:10:00", "text": "Another angle could be inefficient code or algorithms that don't scale well. Maybe the previous team missed optimizing some parts.", "utterranceID": "20260404-5-4e563"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260404-5-4e563"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96bfd9b", "timestamp": "2027-05-12T05:31:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Alice. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20270511-3-ff59a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270511-3-ff59a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e214d622", "timestamp": "2027-05-12T05:32:00", "text": "We implemented a dynamic scaling mechanism for the message queue. Now, it automatically scales up during peak traffic times and scales down when the load decreases. This ensures that the queue can handle high volumes without bottlenecks.", "utterranceID": "20270511-4-a8897"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270511-4-a8897"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_95f6d01c", "timestamp": "2027-05-12T05:37:00", "text": "That's a smart solution, Alice. Thanks for taking care of this so quickly!", "utterranceID": "20270511-5-4ed99"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270511-5-4ed99"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e214d622", "timestamp": "2027-05-12T05:38:00", "text": "No problem, George! Let me know if you notice any more issues. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270511-6-b3f56"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270511-6-b3f56"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_18571957", "timestamp": "2027-05-12T05:41:00", "text": "Thanks again, Alice. I'll keep an eye on it and let you know if anything comes up.", "utterranceID": "20270511-7-e7080"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270511-7-e7080"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96bfd9b", "timestamp": "2027-05-12T05:43:00", "text": "Same here. Appreciate the quick turnaround!", "utterranceID": "20270511-8-5528a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270511-8-5528a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_18571957", "timestamp": "2027-05-19T01:38:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the application making blocking API calls during summary generation.", "utterranceID": "20270518-0-26a11"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270518-0-26a11"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_18571957", "timestamp": "2027-05-19T01:40:00", "text": "The root cause was identified as the use of synchronous XMLHttpRequests, which blocks the UI thread.", "utterranceID": "20270518-1-ccbc3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270518-1-ccbc3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_18571957", "timestamp": "2027-05-19T01:44:00", "text": "After reviewing the implementation, it turns out that this behavior is actually by design. The blocking calls ensure that all necessary data is fetched before the summary is generated, maintaining data consistency.", "utterranceID": "20270518-2-f7485"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270518-2-f7485"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_18571957", "timestamp": "2027-05-19T01:45:00", "text": "I verified this with the original design documents and confirmed that the synchronous requests were intentionally used to avoid partial data rendering.", "utterranceID": "20270518-3-a17da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270518-3-a17da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96bfd9b", "timestamp": "2027-05-19T01:49:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Julia. So, no changes needed on our end?", "utterranceID": "20270518-4-4fe94"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270518-4-4fe94"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_18571957", "timestamp": "2027-05-19T01:54:00", "text": "Correct, @eid_d96bfd9b. No changes are necessary. The current implementation aligns with the intended functionality.", "utterranceID": "20270518-5-1755f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270518-5-1755f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e214d622", "timestamp": "2027-05-19T01:58:00", "text": "Got it, thanks for clarifying, Julia. It's good to know it's working as expected.", "utterranceID": "20270518-6-4c54d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270518-6-4c54d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_95f6d01c", "timestamp": "2027-05-19T02:03:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_18571957. I'll make sure to update the documentation to reflect this as expected behavior.", "utterranceID": "20270518-7-f7f88"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270518-7-f7f88"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-georgegarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-f638bf"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_18571957", "timestamp": "2027-05-19T02:08:00", "text": "Great, thanks George. Let me know if there's anything else you need from me.", "utterranceID": "20270518-8-164ce"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270518-8-164ce"}

